The '''Mapuzo mining village''' was a [[Galactic Empire]]&ndash;controlled [[mining]] [[City|town]] located on the [[planet]] [[Mapuzo]]. The town was home to an [[Hidden Path]] [[Mapuzo safehouse|safehouse]].<ref name="Kenobi III" /> In [[9 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{KenobiDate|III}}</ref> [[Tala Durith]] used the hideout to help [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] and a young [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] to escape from the Imperial forces on the planet.<ref name="Kenobi III" />

